    fields:  # c556
      statement: "hypergumbo catalog returns only human-readable text. Neither --json nor --format json are accepted (silent reject with argparse 'unrecognized arguments'). Programmatic consumers (e.g., CI dashboards listing supported analyzers) must scrape the text format. Other subcommands inconsistently use --json (verify-claims) or --format json (test-coverage, dead-code-maybe); catalog has neither."  # c556
      root_cause: "catalog was implemented as a text-only subcommand; no JSON schema was designed for analyzer listings."  # c556
